# Reports: every run writes a UNIQUE UTC-timestamped file (reports/report-<UTC>.html,
# enforced by tests/conftest.py pytest_configure) so no run can ever overwrite
# another. Those auto files are local-only / ignored; a report given a DESCRIPTIVE
# name (report-findings.html, the full-suite live-run report report-full-live-<date>.html,
# the per-finding evidence reports referenced by findings.json, the guardrail/firewall
# keepers) is committed deliberately. The glob
# matches ONLY the timestamp shape (report-<8 digits>T<6 digits>Z.html), never the
# descriptive names.
reports/report.html
reports/report-????????T??????Z.html

